  {
   "id": "a18-text-17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 597,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 134623,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1780393,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Backups are planned once per router; they don’t depend on what fails. With one link down at most one\nrouter repairs and nothing loops, so a link’s flows are just looked up. A router failure walks only the\nflows that pass it. 200 routers / 600 links: about 2 s (13 s with one full simulation per failure).",
   "originalText": "Backups are planned once per router; they don’t depend on what fails. With one link down at most one\nrouter repairs and nothing loops, so a link’s flows are just looked up. A router failure walks only the\nflows that pass it. 200 routers / 600 links: about 2 s (13 s with one full simulation per failure).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
